&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across engineering, design, and go-to-market to build verification and compliance infrastructure at global scale. Your decisions will directly influence how Stripe adapts to a fast-moving regulatory landscape and keeps users on track across their entire lifecycle with Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
